{"articleNo":"1305","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=1305&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2010학년도 여름 방학중 대구셔틀버스 운행안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2010.07.14","hit":"13616","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"justify\"><!--StartFragment--><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">여름 방학중 본교에서 개설하는 공개강좌 및 도서관을 이용하는 대구거주 학생들에게 등․하교 교통편의를 제공하여 방학기간내 면학분위기를 조성하기 위하여 대구지역 셔틀버스를 운행하오니&nbsp;많이 이용하여 주시기 바랍니다.<br></span></font></font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1. 운행기간 : 2010. 07. 19(월)～08. 31(화) [운행일수 32일]<br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 운행회수 : 등교․하교 각 2회 운행&nbsp;<br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3. 운행노선&nbsp;<br></font></span><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가.</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> 등교<br></span></font><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;- </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">만촌역(07:20)→범어로타리(07:25)→시민회관(07:35)→학교(08:40)<br></span></font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 서부정류장(07:20)→광장코아(07:30)→성서홈플러스(07:40)→학교(08:40)<br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 하교<br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 학교(18:15)→시민회관(19:10)→범어네거리(19:20)→남부정류장(19:30)<br></font></span><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 학교(18:15)→성서홈플러스(19:10)→광장코아(19:20)→서부정류장(19:30)<br></span></font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;4. 운행차량 : 대구고속관광(주) 45인승 관광전세버스<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; 5. 승차대상 : 본교 학생 및 교직원<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; 6.&nbsp;승차장소 : 다목적운동장 뒷쪽 주차장(구미셔틀버스출발지)<br><br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2010. 7. 14.<br><br><br><br><br><font size=\"6\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 학생과장<br></strong></font><br><br></font></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
